+
+`electron-release.yml` installs with `npm ci`, while `ci.yml`'s Electron smoke uses `npm install`
+(which silently repairs a stale lock) — so a lock that drifted from `electron/package.json` is
+invisible to every PR and only explodes on the tag (#15157, #17212: the same 195 missing lines of
+the `electron-builder-squirrel-windows` / `postject` subtree, twice). Prove it before the push:
