+On EUSAGE: `(cd electron && npm install --package-lock-only --ignore-scripts)` from the unchanged
+`package.json` (expect +N/-0, no version changes), re-run the dry-run, commit on the release branch
+(we are before the freeze's squash, so it ships in the tag). Also check `scripts/release/sync-next-cycle.mjs`
+did not resolve the lock as "ours" in the last sync-back (phase-5 §20).
